# Production env — do not hand-copy this file. Generate .env.server with:
#
#   scripts/gen-env-server.sh --app olexfilms.app --realtime wss.olexfilms.app
#
# It starts from .env.example, generates every secret (DB, Redis, SeaweedFS,
# Centrifugo, JWT, Meili, NextAuth, VAPID, wuzapi), wires the internal
# <service>.<prefix>-app URLs and keeps existing values on re-run.
# --rotate renews the secrets; APP_ENCRYPTION_KEY and
# WUZAPI_GLOBAL_ENCRYPTION_KEY are never rotated by it.
#
# Fill by hand afterwards when needed: SMTP_* (or pass --smtp-*),
# WUZAPI_WEBHOOK_URL, LEGACY_*_DSN (F2), SA_* (seed), ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
# (F4 AI assistant; empty = AI disabled, 503 AI_UNAVAILABLE).
#
# F2 cutover (compose.prod.yml passes these to backend and workers; defaults
# come from .env.example):
#   MOBILE_LEGACY_ALIASES=true      old hub app on /api/v1/mobile/legacy/*
#                                   (default false = 404; removed in F5)
#   MOBILE_APP_MIN_VERSION=         426 UPDATE_REQUIRED below this release
#   MOBILE_APP_STORE_URL_IOS=       store links sent with UPDATE_REQUIRED
#   MOBILE_APP_STORE_URL_ANDROID=
#   MOBILE_APP_VERSION_REQUIRED=false
#   MOBILE_APP_UA_PRODUCTS=OlexFilms
#
# Cutover tools in the backend image (run with --entrypoint, e.g.
#   docker compose --env-file .env.server -f compose.prod.yml run --rm
#     --no-deps --entrypoint /app/inventory-reconcile backend):
#   /app/inventory-reconcile, /app/cutover-preflight, /app/cutover-delta-report
#
# Then: make prod-config / make prod-up / make prod-create-super-admin
# Create once on the host: docker network create dokploy-network
# Domains and Traefik: docs/deploy.md
